# SnapWidget

> SnapWidget lets you embed Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, YouTube and X (Twitter) feeds on any website with one embed code. Widgets update on their own as you post, as often as every 5 minutes on paid plans. Free widgets are available for Instagram and Facebook. Paid plans (Lite $8, Pro $14, Developer $99 a month, each with a 14-day free trial) add the feed layout, TikTok, YouTube, hashtag widgets, Shoppable Images and analytics.

